        "quote": "(a) Ten (10) Year Term; Renewal. This Agreement shall be effective for a term beginning on the effective date and ending ten (10) years after the effective date. Thereafter, this Agreement will automatically renew for up to two (2) additional four (4) year terms, unless either party notifies the other party of its intent to terminate the Agreement at least one hundred and eighty (180) days before the termination of the then current term. The additional terms shall be deemed a continuation of this Agreement and not as a new franchise or amendment.",
